[SIZE=5][COLOR=#FF6600][B]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.0.4 - Configurable Welcome Messages![/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Release Date:[/B][/COLOR] October 16, 2025
[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Type:[/B][/COLOR] Feature Enhancement

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#009900]✨ New Features[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]Fully Configurable Join Messages[/B][/COLOR]
All join messages are now completely customizable in [FONT=courier]messages.yml[/FONT]!

[LIST]
[*][B]Multi-Language Support:[/B] No more mixed English/local language messages
[*][B]Server Branding:[/B] Customize welcome messages for your server theme  
[*][B]Random Variations:[/B] 8 different welcome messages keep things fresh
[*][B]Auto-Migration:[/B] Existing servers get new messages automatically
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#6600CC]📝 New Message Categories[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#009900][B]welcomeMessage:[/B][/COLOR] Random spooky welcomes for new players
[COLOR=#009900][B]disableMessageNotification:[/B][/COLOR] Instructions to disable Halloween effects
[COLOR=#009900][B]enableMessageNotification:[/B][/COLOR] Instructions to enable Halloween effects

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#CC3300]🌍 Perfect for International Servers[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]Example - Czech Server:[/B][/COLOR]
[CODE]
welcomeMessage:
  - "👻 Vítej na nejstrašidelnějším serveru, %PLAYER%!"
  - "🎃 %PLAYER% vstoupil do pekelné říše!"

disableMessageNotification:
  - "§7Použij §e/%COMMAND% disable §7pro vypnutí Halloween efektů."
[/CODE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]Example - Spanish Server:[/B][/COLOR]
[CODE]
welcomeMessage:
  - "👻 ¡Bienvenido al servidor más aterrador, %PLAYER%!"

disableMessageNotification:
  - "§7Escribe §e/%COMMAND% disable §7si no quieres efectos."
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#FF6600]🔧 Enhanced Placeholders[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][FONT=courier]%PLAYER%[/FONT] - Player name
[*][FONT=courier]%COMMAND%[/FONT] - Dynamic command prefix (halloween, scary, spooky, etc.)
[/LIST]

The [FONT=courier]%COMMAND%[/FONT] placeholder automatically adapts to your custom command prefix!

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#9900CC]📦 Easy Installation[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Stop your server
[*]Replace JAR with [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.4.jar[/FONT]
[*]Start server → New message categories auto-added
[*]Customize messages in [FONT=courier]plugins/Halloween_Softici/messages.yml[/FONT]
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Compatibility:[/B][/COLOR] Works with all v3.0.0+ configs - no breaking changes!
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Auto-Upgrade:[/B][/COLOR] Existing messages preserved, new ones appended automatically

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#CC3300]🎯 Benefits for Admins[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]No More Language Mix:[/B] Fully localize all join messages
[*][B]Better Branding:[/B] Welcome messages match your server style
[*][B]Player-Friendly:[/B] Clear instructions in your preferred language
[*][B]Zero Maintenance:[/B] Auto-migration handles everything
[/LIST]

